{"updatedAt":"2026-08-13T18:37:35.959Z","createdAt":"2026-08-13T01:47:37.754Z","id":"CTTEr6h962DFCiLX","name":"Telegram Channel Backup - Realtime","active":false,"isArchived":false,"nodes":[{"parameters":{"content":"## CONFIGURACIÓN REQUERIDA\n\n**1. Crear el bot:** habla con @BotFather en Telegram, crea un bot y guarda el Token.\n\n**2. Hacer admin al bot en AMBOS canales:**\n- Canal fuente: agrégalo como administrador con permiso de leer/reenviar mensajes.\n- Canal de respaldo: agrégalo como administrador con permiso de publicar mensajes.\n\n**3. Obtener los Chat IDs (empiezan con -100...):**\n- Reenvía cualquier mensaje del canal a @userinfobot o @RawDataBot, o usa `https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates` después de postear algo, y busca el campo `chat.id`.\n\n**4. Configurar variables de entorno en tu instancia de n8n** (Settings > Environment o `.env`):\n```\nSOURCE_CHANNEL_ID=-100XXXXXXXXXX\nBACKUP_CHANNEL_ID=-100YYYYYYYYYY\n```\nSi tu instancia no permite variables de entorno, reemplaza `{{ $env.SOURCE_CHANNEL_ID }}` y `{{ $env.BACKUP_CHANNEL_ID }}` directamente por los IDs numéricos en los nodos correspondientes.\n\n**5. Crear la credencial 'Telegram API'** en n8n con el Token del bot, y asignarla en todos los nodos de Telegram (actualmente están con el placeholder `TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID`).","height":480,"width":480},"id":"0ebbfdc9-d19e-4189-a011-b1072451745e","name":"Notas de Configuración","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-1744,128]},{"parameters":{"content":"## LIMITACIONES Y MANEJO DE ERRORES\n\n- **Límite de tamaño:** la Bot API de Telegram no permite descargar/reenviar archivos de más de 20 MB. Videos o documentos grandes van a fallar en 'Send Video'/'Send Document' — con Continue On Fail activado, el flujo sigue pero ese ítem se pierde; considera loguearlo aparte.\n- **Rate limits:** Telegram limita ~30 mensajes/segundo global y ~20/minuto por chat de destino en canales. El nodo 'Wait' (1.5s) al final de cada ejecución ayuda, pero si llegan ráfagas de posts, podrías necesitar aumentar el tiempo.\n- **Error Workflow:** este JSON NO incluye el workflow de notificación de errores (debe ser un workflow separado con un nodo 'Error Trigger'). Créalo aparte y asígnalo en Settings de este workflow > Error Workflow, para recibir un aviso por Telegram si algo falla.\n- **Media groups (álbumes):** en esta versión cada mensaje de un álbum se reenvía individualmente, no agrupado. Es una mejora para una v2.\n- **Historial completo:** este flujo solo captura mensajes NUEVOS desde que se activa (Bot API). Migrar el historial completo requiere MTProto, que es otro workflow.","height":420,"width":480},"id":"e573ea25-e266-4b01-90cb-9379e57d502a","name":"Notas de Límites y Errores","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[-1744,656]},{"parameters":{"updates":["channel_post","edited_channel_post"],"additionalFields":{"download":true,"imageSize":"large","chatIds":"={{ $env.SOURCE_CHANNEL_ID }}"}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[-1152,384],"id":"3f9563fb-0623-43fb-9be2-3eba5080b891","name":"Telegram Trigger - Channel Posts","webhookId":"telegram-channel-backup-webhook","credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"8DnRHT4TsCONUK6M","name":"Telegram account 2"}}},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"const items = [];\n\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const data = item.json;\n  const msg = data.channel_post || data.message || data.edited_channel_post;\n\n  if (!msg) continue;\n\n  const mediaType =\n    msg.photo ? 'photo' :\n    msg.document ? 'document' :\n    msg.video ? 'video' :\n    msg.audio ? 'audio' :\n    msg.voice ? 'voice' :\n    msg.animation ? 'animation' :\n    msg.sticker ? 'sticker' :\n    msg.video_note ? 'video_note' :\n    'text';\n\n  let caption = msg.caption || msg.text || '';\n  // Telegram permite hasta 1024 caracteres de caption; dejamos margen para el prefijo de backup.\n  const MAX_CAPTION = 900;\n  if (caption.length > MAX_CAPTION) {\n    caption = caption.slice(0, MAX_CAPTION) + '... [truncado]';\n  }\n\n  const originalDate = msg.date ? new Date(msg.date * 1000).toISOString() : null;\n\n  items.push({\n    json: {\n      message_id: msg.message_id,\n      chat_id: msg.chat?.id,\n      mediaType,\n      caption,\n      originalDate,\n      file_id:\n        msg.photo?.[msg.photo.length - 1]?.file_id ||\n        msg.document?.file_id ||\n        msg.video?.file_id ||\n        msg.audio?.file_id ||\n        msg.voice?.file_id ||\n        msg.animation?.file_id ||\n        msg.sticker?.file_id ||\n        null,\n      file_name: msg.document?.file_name || msg.video?.file_name || null,\n      mime_type: msg.document?.mime_type || msg.video?.mime_type || null,\n      media_group_id: msg.media_group_id || null,\n      hasBinary: !!item.binary,\n      originalMsg: msg\n    },\n    binary: item.binary || {}\n  });\n}\n\nreturn items;"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[-896,384],"id":"46a06844-1e69-4435-8fdd-ab898a5e5480","name":"Normalize Message Data"},{"parameters":{"rules":{"values":[{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":2},"conditions":[{"id":"rule-photo","leftValue":"={{ $json.mediaType }}","rightValue":"photo","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"}}],"combinator":"and"},"renameOutput":true,"outputKey":"Photo"},{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":2},"conditions":[{"id":"rule-document","leftValue":"={{ $json.mediaType }}","rightValue":"document","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"}}],"combinator":"and"},"renameOutput":true,"outputKey":"Document"},{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":2},"conditions":[{"id":"rule-video","leftValue":"={{ $json.mediaType }}","rightValue":"video","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"}}],"combinator":"and"},"renameOutput":true,"outputKey":"Video"},{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":2},"conditions":[{"id":"rule-text","leftValue":"={{ $json.mediaType }}","rightValue":"text","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"equals"}}],"combinator":"and"},"renameOutput":true,"outputKey":"Text"}]},"options":{"fallbackOutput":"extra","renameFallbackOutput":"Other"}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.switch","typeVersion":3,"position":[-640,384],"id":"c92ddde0-ee9c-4f65-a662-770f8d17eb12","name":"Route by Media Type"},{"parameters":{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":2},"conditions":[{"id":"photo-c1","leftValue":"={{ $json.file_id }}","rightValue":"","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEmpty"}},{"id":"photo-c2","leftValue":"={{ $json.hasBinary }}","rightValue":true,"operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"equals"}}],"combinator":"or"},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","typeVersion":2,"position":[-400,176],"id":"782604e3-d150-4066-9efd-1c1ea6feaa90","name":"Has Photo Content?"},{"parameters":{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":2},"conditions":[{"id":"doc-c1","leftValue":"={{ $json.file_id }}","rightValue":"","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEmpty"}},{"id":"doc-c2","leftValue":"={{ $json.hasBinary }}","rightValue":true,"operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"equals"}}],"combinator":"or"},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","typeVersion":2,"position":[-400,352],"id":"3ceebcc5-7df0-44f8-90ce-8ba1bbd0318f","name":"Has Document Content?"},{"parameters":{"conditions":{"options":{"caseSensitive":true,"leftValue":"","typeValidation":"strict","version":2},"conditions":[{"id":"vid-c1","leftValue":"={{ $json.file_id }}","rightValue":"","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"notEmpty"}},{"id":"vid-c2","leftValue":"={{ $json.hasBinary }}","rightValue":true,"operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"equals"}}],"combinator":"or"},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","typeVersion":2,"position":[-400,528],"id":"b4856841-bf11-4e09-8b15-5027df87f6c9","name":"Has Video Content?"},{"parameters":{},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.noOp","typeVersion":1,"position":[-144,64],"id":"2de8c621-2d31-4569-9e2f-7a1afb3c83fc","name":"Skip - No Photo Content"},{"parameters":{},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.noOp","typeVersion":1,"position":[-144,256],"id":"dd022a17-aac9-44e6-a613-a61c72dee180","name":"Skip - No Document Content"},{"parameters":{},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.noOp","typeVersion":1,"position":[-144,448],"id":"528f366c-f608-4fc2-88c3-49734a3ebb14","name":"Skip - No Video Content"},{"parameters":{"operation":"sendPhoto","chatId":"={{ $env.BACKUP_CHANNEL_ID }}","file":"={{ $json.file_id }}","additionalFields":{"caption":"=📦 Backup | ID: {{ $json.message_id }} | {{ $json.originalDate }}\n\n{{ $json.caption }}","disable_notification":false}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","typeVersion":1.2,"position":[-144,176],"id":"9a9a9143-6837-45e3-81b9-509970ca6a42","name":"Send Photo","webhookId":"797b27e6-d225-409f-b921-6081db2697c3","credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"9LOFFx8rcqBcCfjI","name":"Telegram account 3"}},"continueOnFail":true},{"parameters":{"operation":"sendDocument","chatId":"={{ $env.BACKUP_CHANNEL_ID }}","file":"={{ $json.file_id }}","additionalFields":{"caption":"=📦 Backup | ID: {{ $json.message_id }} | {{ $json.originalDate }}\n\n{{ $json.caption }}","disable_notification":false}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","typeVersion":1.2,"position":[-144,352],"id":"0440ee29-f320-431c-a6e9-c72035b06c41","name":"Send Document","webhookId":"6a2c009d-eb33-43af-a98d-41739b6cb70a","credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"9LOFFx8rcqBcCfjI","name":"Telegram account 3"}},"continueOnFail":true},{"parameters":{"operation":"sendVideo","chatId":"={{ $env.BACKUP_CHANNEL_ID }}","file":"={{ $json.file_id }}","additionalFields":{"caption":"=📦 Backup | ID: {{ $json.message_id }} | {{ $json.originalDate }}\n\n{{ $json.caption }}","disable_notification":false}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","typeVersion":1.2,"position":[-144,528],"id":"dcc59f9d-32aa-4733-87a7-3806730bf1f7","name":"Send Video","webhookId":"db231480-2571-4306-af02-5058d19ad25f","credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"9LOFFx8rcqBcCfjI","name":"Telegram account 3"}},"continueOnFail":true},{"parameters":{"chatId":"={{ $env.BACKUP_CHANNEL_ID }}","text":"=📦 Backup | ID: {{ $json.message_id }} | {{ $json.originalDate }}\n\n{{ $json.caption }}","additionalFields":{"disable_notification":false}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","typeVersion":1.2,"position":[-400,704],"id":"02e02a3e-12ab-4901-9896-405fe77485ba","name":"Send Text","webhookId":"bd36eb92-29b3-48e6-9c99-21d5aea61a1e","credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"9LOFFx8rcqBcCfjI","name":"Telegram account 3"}},"continueOnFail":true},{"parameters":{},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.noOp","typeVersion":1,"position":[-400,864],"id":"6e8ec5c4-7684-4425-99eb-7c65cba533f2","name":"Other Media Type - Log/Skip"},{"parameters":{"mode":"combine","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.merge","typeVersion":3,"position":[160,432],"id":"dcd436e9-c052-4304-8333-4f800c2d4c35","name":"Merge Branches"},{"parameters":{"amount":1.5},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.wait","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[416,432],"id":"16f3e107-d709-4958-8890-bc60fac9fccd","name":"Wait (Rate Limit)","webhookId":"6f1e61e6-084b-4f25-a350-a3f66ecd0068"},{"parameters":{"updates":["message"],"additionalFields":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger","typeVersion":1.5,"position":[-1056,848],"id":"fa08368d-422e-4aea-a00a-144c1811980b","name":"Telegram Trigger","webhookId":"b01b8650-4e39-4cda-a7a0-f5e367a42307","credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"9LOFFx8rcqBcCfjI","name":"Telegram account 3"}}},{"parameters":{"chatId":"-1003636325847","text":"hola es","additionalFields":{"appendAttribution":false}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","typeVersion":1.2,"position":[-848,848],"id":"7d1f93fc-1dba-4af5-8aee-347a56e715f1","name":"Send a text messa